Z||000008||DR650SE||12-09-2001||12:04 AM||||The beach was a blast!  Did I also mention that I saw 7 Ferraris, 3 Vipers, Countless Porches, and Vettes, 1 very hot girl!(my girl!) 2 very nice Fieros. One was a yellow GT excellent condition, the other a white formula.  I talked to the owner of the white formula.  The owner wanted to sell it for a firm 6k.  He said that he already had offers up to $5800 but really needed to get at least 6k out of it.  He said he wanted to sell it because he felt he would damage it if he kept it.  He just got it from his mother about a month ago.  It was white and flawless with only 20k miles on it.  It was an auto.  I told him about this site as I know you all are always in the market for a nice ride.  He may sometime list it here.  The car had black lace wheels.  Very nice ride!  <p>[This message has been edited by DR650SE (edited 12-09-2001).]||||reg||14
